<%- include('../partials/head', { title: 'Liaisa: every enquiry answered, every quote yours to approve' }) %>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/site-bar', { brand: 'Liaisa', links: true }) %>
  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero hero--split" aria-labelledby="hero-h">
      <div class="hero__copy">
        <h1 id="hero-h">Every enquiry answered.<br>Every quote yours to approve.</h1>
        <p class="lead">A customer says what they need. Liaisa asks for anything missing, the server works out the price, and you approve it before anything is sent.</p>
        <div class="cluster">
          <a class="btn lg" href="/enquire">Try the demo enquiry</a>
          <a class="btn secondary lg" href="/owner/login">Owner login</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="hero-demo" id="hero-demo" aria-labelledby="demo-cap">
        <div class="phone" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="phone__screen">
            <p class="demo-head"><span>Enquiry</span><span class="tag">Form</span></p>
            <p class="demo-msg demo-msg--you s1">Veg lunch for 60 on Saturday</p>
            <p class="demo-msg demo-msg--ai s2"><span class="who">Liaisa <%- include('../partials/ai-badge') %></span>Which area is the event in?</p>
            <p class="demo-msg demo-msg--you s3">Koramangala</p>
            <div class="demo-quote s4">
              <p><strong>Quote for Priya</strong></p>
              <p class="slate">Veg buffet · 60 guests · Sat</p>
              <strong class="demo-total">₹31,185</strong>
              <span class="calc-note">Calculated by the server</span>
            </div>
            <div class="demo-owner s5"><span>Owner</span><span class="demo-approve">Approve<span class="demo-tap"></span></span></div>
            <div class="demo-sent s6"><span class="tick">✓</span> Quote sent</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption id="demo-cap" class="slate small">
          One quote, start to finish.
          <button class="btn text" type="button" data-toggle-anim="hero-demo" aria-pressed="false">Pause animation</button>
        </figcaption>
        <p class="sr">What happens: the customer writes “Veg lunch for 60 on Saturday”. Liaisa, an AI assistant, asks which area. The customer answers Koramangala. A quote appears with a total of ₹31,185 calculated by the server. The owner taps Approve. The quote is sent.</p>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-h">
      <h2 id="how-h">How it works</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <span class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v10H9l-5 4z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 12h5"/></svg></span>
          <div><span class="num">Step 1</span><strong>Describe your need</strong><span class="slate">Type what you want, like “veg lunch for 60 on Saturday”. If something is missing, Liaisa asks one short question.</span></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8-7 10-4-2-7-5.5-7-10V6z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg></span>
          <div><span class="num">Step 2</span><strong>Owner approves the quote</strong><span class="slate">The server prices it from the owner’s rate card. The owner checks it, edits it if needed, and approves it.</span></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="7" y="3" width="10" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M10 12l1.8 1.8L15 10"/></svg></span>
          <div><span class="num">Step 3</span><strong>Accept on your phone</strong><span class="slate">You get the quote by WhatsApp or email and accept it in one tap.</span></div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="safe-h">
      <h2 id="safe-h">Why it’s safe</h2>
      <div class="safe">
        <p><strong>The server calculates the price.</strong> The assistant never works out or promises a price.</p>
        <p><strong>The owner approves every quote.</strong> Nothing reaches a customer until the owner says yes.</p>
        <p><strong>You can see what is AI.</strong> Anything written by AI carries a <%- include('../partials/ai-badge') %> mark.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <h2 id="contact-title">Contact</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p class="tag-row"><span class="tag">Form</span> Your message goes to the business by email.</p>
        <% if (contactNotice) { %>
          <p class="notice notice-<%= contactNotice.tone %>" role="<%= contactNotice.tone === 'ok' ? 'status' : 'alert' %>"><%= contactNotice.text %></p>
        <% } %>
        <p id="contact-status" class="notice" hidden></p>
        <form id="contact-form" method="post" action="/api/contact" data-enhance novalidate>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required>
            <p class="field-error" id="error-name" hidden></p>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="email">Your email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="200" required>
            <p class="field-error" id="error-email" hidden></p>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" maxlength="2000" required></textarea>
            <p class="field-error" id="error-message" hidden></p>
          </div>
          <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
            <label for="website">Leave this field empty</label>
            <input id="website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn block">Send message</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>
    <%- include('../partials/legend') %>
  </main>
  <script src="<%= asset('/js/ui.js') %>" defer></script>
  <script src="<%= asset('/js/contact.js') %>" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
